        ValidatorFactory factory = Validation.buildDefaultValidatorFactory();
        this.validator = factory.getValidator();
    }

    // Your service methods...
}
```

### Conclusion
The missing **Hibernate Validator** is the root cause of the exception. After adding the required dependencies, your Spring Boot application should start correctly and the validation in `MyService` should work as expected.

