2. **Use Class Names in Your JSX**:

   ```javascript
   const MyComponent = () => {
       return (
           <button className={styles.primaryButton}>
               Click Me
           </button>
       );
   };
   ```

### Summary

- **CSS Modules** allow you to scope your styles and generate unique class names automatically.
- For global styles, you can manually map class names to JavaScript objects for better readability and management.

