### 2. Backend (Spring Boot)

#### a. Add Dependency
Add the following dependency to your `pom.xml` for Apache POI, which is used for handling DOCX files.

```xml
<dependency>
    <groupId>org.apache.poi</groupId>
    <artifactId>poi-ooxml</artifactId>
