2. **Backend (API Routes)**: You can define backend endpoints that handle business logic like saving data, interacting with databases, or processing files. These API routes are server-side only and can be accessed from your frontend.

### How to Handle Backend Logic in Next.js:

#### 1. Frontend (Page Component)
