Here’s how you can resolve the issue within the **Next.js project**:

---

### 1. Use `"use client"` in Next.js Components
In the Next.js project, ensure that any component using your library is marked as a **Client Component**. This is done by adding `"use client"` at the top of the file where the library is imported.

#### Example:
