✅ **Better Readability**: Extracting `renderContent()` makes logic easier to follow.  
✅ **More Maintainable**: If a new format is added in `SupportedOutFormats`, only `renderContent()` needs updating.  
✅ **Efficient Debug Rendering**: Debug elements are now grouped logically at the bottom.

